 r←Test_OptionsTool_004(stopFlag batchFlag);⎕TRAP;parms;n
⍝ Exercise "OptionsTool" with invalid `default`.
 r←∆Failed
 ⎕TRAP←(999 'C' '. ⍝ Deliberate error')(0 'N')

 parms←#.APLGUI.APLGUI.OptionsTool.CreateParms
 parms.default←1 2
 :Trap 11
     n←parms #.APLGUI.APLGUI.OptionsTool.Create(⍕¨1+⍳10)
     →FailsIf 1
 :Else
     →PassesIf'Invalid: "default"; must be Boolean'≡↑⎕DM
 :EndTrap

 r←∆OK
